 of  the best vert writers we've got a  legends uh skate session  on the 27th um with people like steve  caballero christian osoye and myself  mike frazier andy mcdonald  so i'm excited i feel like  uh i've been trying to push for  something like this for the last few  years obviously it got shelved over the  last year and a half for uh and now  we're going for it  it's great to talk to you again tony we  appreciate your time and uh have fun in  utah thank you  yeah thanks john that's uh tony hawk and  uh  that's seton seton's geeking out like  he's a girl watching the beatles perform  at shea stadium there

